        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"><em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. The system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Appointment confirmation</span></p>
<p>Your appointment has been successfully booked as follow:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>CONFIRMATION NUMBER: ${number}</li>
<li>DATE AND TIME: ${window_start}</li>
<li>LOCATION: 131 Queen Street, 8<sup>th</sup> Floor, Room 0-53&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p>Please:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>Print and fill out the attached forms prior to arriving on site.</li>
<li>Arrive 5 minutes prior to your appointment</li>
</ul>
<p>Remember to:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>Bring your provincial Health Card</li>
<li>Wear short sleeves</li>
<li><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Follow all applicable <strong>COVID-19</strong> health and safety guidelines</span></li>
<li>Show your Hill identification <strong>card</strong></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>If you need to cancel or re-schedule your appointment, please <a href="https://hoccdc.service-now.com/services?id=ticket&amp;is_new_order=true&amp;table=x_hccc_hoc_ohs_vaccination_appointment&amp;sys_id=${sys_id}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">click here</a>.</strong></p>
<p>For questions please contact the health and wellness team at <a title="healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca" href="mailto:healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca">healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca</a> or by calling (613) 943-5555.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><a name="francais"></a><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Confirmation de rendez-vous</span></p>
<p>Votre rendez-vous a &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;serv&eacute; comme suit:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>NUMERO DE CONFIRMATION: ${number}</li>
<li>DATE ET HEURE: ${window_start}</li>
<li>ENDROIT: 131 rue Queen, 8<sup>e</sup> &eacute;tage, pi&egrave;ce 0-53&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p>S.v.p:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>remplir et imprimer, avant m&ecirc;me d&rsquo;arriver sur les lieux, les formulaires ci-joints.</li>
<li>arriver 5 min. avant votre rendez-vous</li>
</ul>
<p>Rappel:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>porter un chandail &agrave; manches courtes</li>
<li>Apporter votre carte sant&eacute; provinciale</li>
<li><span style="text-decoration: underline;">suivre les mesures courantes de sant&eacute; s&eacute;curit&eacute; contre la COVID-19</span></li>
<li>pr&eacute;sent&eacute; votre carte d'identification de la Colline</li>
</ul>
<p><strong> Si vous devez annuler ou modifier votre rendez-vous, veuillez <a href="https://hoccdc.service-now.com/services?id=ticket&amp;is_new_order=true&amp;table=x_hccc_hoc_ohs_vaccination_appointment&amp;sys_id=03f7c5e53b605650aeb1ebc964e45a04">cliquer ici</a>. </strong></p>
<p>Pour toute question, veuillez communiquer avec l'&eacute;quipe de sant&eacute; et mieux-&ecirc;tre &agrave; <a title="healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca" href="mailto:healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca">healthandwellness-santeetmieux-etre@parl.gc.ca</a> ou en composant le (613) 943-5555</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Merci,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
<p>Chambre des communes</p>
<p>50 Rue O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">e</span> &eacute;tage <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Bureau: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>]]></message_html>
